from: torres-zeke

== mail
- Every song, tomorrow at five, the music room. This week: the lighthouse one. I'm right about the second verse. Come and tell Takahashi.

== ask
- Every song at five? We're on the lighthouse one.
- Come and settle the second verse for us. Pick my side.   #funny

== here
- No, no, it's "the light comes round", not "the night comes down".   #funny
- Next record! Don't touch the scratched one.

== thanks
- You sing along in the music room. Five people sing slightly different words at once, and the whole room takes sides.

== chatter
- Every song tonight. Zeke's been practising the wrong words all week.   #funny
